# Generated performance and profiling output.
#
# Raw benchmark runs, profiler traces and scratch logs are not repository
# content: they are large, machine-specific and reproducible. Nothing under
# perf-results/ is tracked any more; a directory genuinely worth keeping must
# be force-added (git add -f) and reviewed, never picked up automatically.
/perf-results/*
/profiler-log.json
/out.txt

# Scratch analysis notes, kept locally. Maintainer decision 2026-09-02: not
# repository content, and ignored rather than merely untracked so it cannot be
# swept up by a `git add -A`.
/CODEX_ANALYSIS_WARMUP.md
